{"id":"vod_bf_38614","vodId":"38614","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"小林家的龙女仆 国语版","name_cn":"小林家的龙女仆 国语版","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/abac3cba3a50f6565faf5c23f58fc583.jpg"},"summary":"小林（田村睦心 配音）是一位非常平凡的程序员，在一次偶然之中救了一条名叫托尔（桑原由气 配音）的龙，为了报答小林的救命之恩，托尔化身成为了女仆的样子来到了小林家中，就这样，小林和龙女仆的同居生活就此拉开序幕。　　古灵精怪我行我素的康娜卡姆依（长绳麻理亚 配音）、对人类有着非常深的成见，但似乎不太聪明的样子的艾露玛（高田忧希 配音）、心思细腻温柔又稳重的大姐姐露科亚（高桥未奈美 配音）、痛恨着人类，但又无法自持的被人类所发明出来的游戏所吸引的法夫纳（小野大辅 配音），自托尔之后，小林的身边接二连三的出现了这些性格迥异的龙族们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:54:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiaolinjiadelongnvpuguoyuban/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"na